<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>La grande riabilitazione sociale di Ismael</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap');

:root {
  --pink: #ff78ad;
  --purple: #a78bfa;
  --yellow: #ffe66d;
  --green: #a8e6a3;
  --blue: #8edbff;
  --orange: #ffad70;
  --ink: #34264d;
  --paper: #fffaf1;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
  color: var(--ink);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, #ffe0ed 0 8%, transparent 25%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, #d9ceff 0 8%, transparent 25%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 90%, #d5f5d2 0 8%, transparent 25%),
    #fff8ed;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

h1, h2, h3, .display {
  font-family: 'Baloo 2', cursive;
}

button, input, textarea { font: inherit; }

button { cursor: pointer; }

a { color: #7650c9; font-weight: 900; }

.container {
  width: min(100% - 30px, 850px);
  margin: auto;
}

.hero {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 55px 15px 35px;
  position: relative;
}

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--yellow);
  padding: 8px 18px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-weight: 900;
  transform: rotate(-2deg);
  box-shadow: 3px 4px 0 var(--ink);
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);
  line-height: .98;
  margin: 25px auto 15px;
  max-width: 750px;
  color: #7c52c8;
  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #ffd5e6;
}

.hero p {
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 12px auto;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.frog-area {
  margin: 20px auto;
  height: 190px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  position: relative;
}

.frog {
  font-size: 115px;
  display: inline-block;
  animation: frogBounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 0 #b4e7a9);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.frog:hover { animation: frogDance .5s infinite alternate; }

@keyframes frogBounce {
  0%,100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-4deg); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-17px) rotate(4deg); }
}

@keyframes frogDance {
  from { transform: rotate(-15deg) scale(1.05); }
  to { transform: rotate(15deg) scale(1.15); }
}

.floating {
  position: absolute;
  font-size: 28px;
  animation: floaty 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.f1 { left: 20%; top: 10px; }
.f2 { right: 20%; top: 25px; animation-delay: .7s; }
.f3 { left: 27%; bottom: 5px; animation-delay: 1.2s; }

@keyframes floaty {
  0%,100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-15px) rotate(15deg); }
}

.card {
  background: white;
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 25px;
  padding: 25px;
  margin: 22px 0;
  box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 var(--ink);
}

.card.pink { background: #ffe1ed; }
.card.yellow { background: #fff1a8; }
.card.green { background: #dff7d9; }
.card.blue { background: #dff4ff; }
.card.purple { background: #eee5ff; }
.card.orange { background: #ffe4cc; }

h2 {
  font-size: 2rem;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

h3 {
  font-size: 1.45rem;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
}

p { line-height: 1.65; }

.small {
  font-size: .9rem;
  opacity: .8;
}

.progress-wrap {
  background: white;
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 7px;
  margin: 25px 0;
}

.progress-bar {
  height: 20px;
  width: 0%;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--pink), var(--purple), var(--blue), var(--green));
  transition: width .5s ease;
}

.progress-text {
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-top: 8px;
}

.mission {
  position: relative;
  transition: transform .2s;
}

.mission:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) rotate(-.3deg); }

.mission-number {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--yellow);
  border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  padding: 5px 13px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.mission label.check {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin: 18px 0 5px;
}

.mission input[type="checkbox"] {
  appearance: none;
  width: 27px;
  height: 27px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: white;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.mission input[type="checkbox"]:checked {
  background: var(--green);
  position: relative;
}

.mission input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after {
  content: "✓";
  position: absolute;
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 900;
  left: 3px;
  top: -3px;
}

textarea, input[type="text"], input[type="email"] {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 13px;
  border: 2px solid #b8a6d8;
  border-radius: 13px;
  background: #fff;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-top: 8px;
  outline: none;
}

textarea:focus, input:focus {
  border-color: #8857d8;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #e6d9ff;
}

textarea {
  min-height: 85px;
  resize: vertical;
}

.map-link {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 7px 5px 5px 0;
  padding: 9px 14px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: white;
  border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  text-decoration: none;
  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink);
  transition: .2s;
}

.map-link:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
  background: var(--yellow);
}

.compliment {
  text-align: center;
  min-height: 150px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.compliment-text {
  font-family: 'Baloo 2', cursive;
  font-size: 1.7rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.2;
  max-width: 600px;
}

button.main-btn {
  background: var(--pink);
  color: var(--ink);
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  font-weight: 900;
  box-shadow: 4px 5px 0 var(--ink);
  transition: .2s;
}

button.main-btn:hover {
  transform: translate(2px, 3px);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink);
}

.quote {
  font-family: 'Baloo 2', cursive;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
}

.choice-list {
  display: grid;
  gap: 12px;
  margin: 20px 0;
}

.choice {
  display: block;
  padding: 16px;
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 17px;
  background: white;
  font-weight: 900;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: .2s;
}

.choice input { margin-right: 10px; accent-color: #8b5bd6; }

.choice:has(input:checked) {
  background: var(--green);
  transform: scale(1.02);
}

.send-area {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px 0 50px;
}

.send-btn {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  padding: 17px 30px !important;
  background: var(--green) !important;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
  opacity: .7;
  font-size: .85rem;
}

.sticker {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--yellow);
  padding: 4px 12px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-weight: 900;
  transform: rotate(2deg);
}

#successMessage {
  display: none;
  background: var(--green);
  padding: 20px;
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-top: 20px;
}

.sparkle {
  position: fixed;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 20;
  animation: sparkle 1s forwards;
  font-size: 25px;
}

@keyframes sparkle {
  from { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
  to { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-90px) scale(1.8) rotate(90deg); }
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .hero { padding-top: 35px; }
  .card { padding: 19px; }
  .frog { font-size: 95px; }
  .compliment-text { font-size: 1.4rem; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="hero container">
  <span class="tag">UN'OPERAZIONE ALTAMENTE SCIENTIFICA</span>

  <h1>La grande riabilitazione sociale di Ismael</h1>

  <p>
    Un progetto segreto. Una rana. Una ragazza da riportare
    alla vita sociale. E una quantità discutibile di complimenti.
  </p>

  <div class="frog-area">
    <span class="floating f1">★</span>
    <span class="floating f2">♡</span>
    <span class="floating f3">✿</span>
    <div class="frog" onclick="frogMessage()" title="Cliccami, Zahra!">🐸</div>
  </div>

  <span class="sticker">Direttore del progetto: Ismael</span>
</header>

<main class="container">

  <section class="card pink">
    <h2>Benvenuta, Baby!</h2>
    <p>
      Cara Zahra, sei stata selezionata per un esperimento sociale
      di fondamentale importanza. Il tuo compito è uscire, esplorare,
